@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<section class="hero-section">
    <div class="hero-glass text-start">
        <h1 class="hero-title mb-4">About Furniture & Garden Design</h1>

        <p class="hero-subtitle">
            Furniture & Garden Design is a cutting-edge platform that leverages AI technology to 
            assist users in creating custom furniture and garden designs. Our mission is to simplify the design process, 
            making it accessible and enjoyable for everyone, regardless of their design experience.
            We offer as 2D  and 3D models based on user-provided specifications and reference images.

        </p>

        <hr class="my-4" />

        <p>
            The project utilizes ASP.NET MVC with Individual Accounts, divided into 
            Data / Services / Web layers. The admin manages the catalog and categories, while users can place orders and leave reviews.

            Expect future enhancements, including advanced AI features, expanded design options, and improved user experience.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

